{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "13854ecb62c96260387938d2adaab68b5e90bffa4c329bd199785bcc0c082bd7", "ja": "ぐるるるーっ！　がおー！　……ダメだ。違う。\nくう～っ、難しいなぁ～。", "zh": "吼呜呜呜──！吼喔──！\n……不行，这样不对。唔～好难喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b1c0b3622ac6059ccc1e3147a9d4d48d85b889a673a8d982d885069cb77243cf", "ja": "……真？　どうしたんだ、変な……いや、\n大きな声を出して。", "zh": "……真？你是怎么了，发出这么怪的……\n我是说，发出这么大的叫声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "51e99bf8f960d0226453dc21b0efcdd8404bbc151858734717fbc45093a5d078", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、聞いてください！\nボク、どうしたらライオンになれますか！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，在下有件事想问你！\n怎样才能变成狮子呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6fc74864daf2b2cbac1c741afd59b1edfc8b561356cff3dec5683dbd92f7e695", "ja": "ちょっと、落ち着いて落ち着いて。\n最初から説明してくれないか。", "zh": "等一下，冷静点冷静点。\n可以从头跟我解释吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "38d27180a940bf96a6233023d42eceec6336e274c1062cc4f93f07cd13c17b8d", "ja": "はい……。この前のお仕事で、ホワイトライオンの\n赤ちゃんと遊ばせてもらったじゃないですか。", "zh": "好……在上次的工作中，\n在下不是有和白狮子的宝宝一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "2b767e813b3d4091288e46b2867c20a10500ee71d5dfb9534b859897fdc9b8a2", "ja": "その時、ず～っと一緒にいたいって思っちゃうくらい\nあの子たちにメロメロになっちゃったんです。", "zh": "那时，在下彻底迷上那群小白狮，\n当时只想永～远和牠们待在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "14134ed39c309478df8405e15b9538450acdb04913d885b076917fa7e3b68425", "ja": "確かにかわいかったよな。あのかわいさなら、\n真がそう思っちゃうのもわかるよ。", "zh": "牠们的确很可爱呢。\n在那么可爱的动物面前，难怪真会如此着迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "5a51f10d92afaf283a6fff3e1e4f135552d8526441f2da78179d97cf58a75c7a", "ja": "違うんです！　ボクも最初はそうだと思ってました。\nでも、あの子はかわいいだけじゃないんです！", "zh": "不是的！其实在下一开始也这么想。\n但是，小白狮不光只有可爱而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "3653cae50eb4fb5419364857018a81340d3bfd8dc750317f2f1154bbc1a55d87", "ja": "例えば……、風に吹かれて目を細めた時とか、\nところどころであの子『ライオン』の顔をしたんです。", "zh": "比方说……因为风吹而眯起眼睛的时候等等，\n不时可以看到牠露出『狮子』的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "2191e02400eebc2ea1d765d5440147de759a843652d6ef1bc8edf7da39f9cb9f", "ja": "その表情が、すごく凛々しくて。ただカッコイイとか\nじゃない。本物の、魂からの凛々しさっていうか……！", "zh": "那样的表情非常威风凛凛。不仅仅只是帅气而已，\n而是真正的，打从灵魂深处透露出来的气势……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7c64242d99d9209a84adcd0479ccbcc4e7abfc9dbd924a5017efdc22c62cc6b1", "ja": "まあ……子供とはいえ、本物の肉食獣だからな。", "zh": "也是……年纪小归小，毕竟还是如假包换的肉食动物嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "da21ac65ede1fcf3de121a6d77d436203129d6e44bc528865abf5bf14107374a", "ja": "そうなんです、本物なんです！\nそれがボクのハートにグイグイ来たんですよ～！", "zh": "没错，牠们是货真价实的！\n就是这点打动了在下的心呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "96e42448cda1378ac7325f118c5632b62fcd816e1aef91ecf9663fc82c3de433", "ja": "ボクのこと、カッコイイっていってくれる子は\nいっぱいいます。でも、ボクは……本物じゃない！", "zh": "有很多粉丝说在下很帅气。\n但是，在下……根本不是正牌的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0824f7b983d70ab4e9af8b23ce69eef5f37bc847bcd14227eeeee8c189065776", "ja": "まあ……。\n真は人間で、しかも女の子だからな……。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n毕竟真是人类，而且是女孩子嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "895da41ce069d6586aa3553e481c11dc705ad003f51bf084c6d2f5c977288c61", "ja": "そう、ボクは人間の女の子……。女の子……？\nへへっ、ボクが女の子かぁ～♪", "zh": "没错，在下是人类女孩……女孩子……？\n嘿嘿！在下是女孩子耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "ad81302df6c663898ed8d877915f2e5bc46972a5a8d5417864d405a8178a75e4", "ja": "って違う、そうじゃない！　{$P$}、\n今はそういうのやめてください！　後でお願いします！", "zh": "等等，不对啦！{$P$}，\n现在不是讲这个的时候！要讲待会再讲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "deb57a7f38bb96248f15a73e2ca8a07a8774b594414220aa1b5babc72cd6cd9f", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nわかった、また後にするよ。", "zh": "是、是吗？\n知道了，那我待会再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "80cb23f78ace7fc48fd72b51236af18ca140a8b386a6e597e893dc456ce6045c", "ja": "ボク、アイドルとして、みんなの期待にちゃんと\n応えたいんです。本物になりたいんです！", "zh": "身为偶像，在下不想辜负大家的期待。\n在下想成为正牌的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "8d3dd25174e3de23dd51505350ee538e9859e12cda0eb8494984fa7dcca5da10", "ja": "だから、教えてください{$P$}！\nボク、どうしたらライオンになれますか！？", "zh": "所以，请你告诉在下，{$P$}！\n要怎么做才能成为狮子呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_1019", "source_sha256": "b6906fc0fe4559178d2e30d6840b5f1a93f89c1c1e1af2cf35121e3c1c9e5b81", "ja": "カッコいい……！", "zh": "好帅气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f03aca67ee446652bf9aa14105db2d2039722193389022e7a0d19c09cc70b97c", "ja": "カッコいい……。\n本当にカッコいいぞ、真！", "zh": "好帅气……\n你实在太帅了，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "44778662d7c98b7522370691a4aee4254a3f8ea6cb63b0692dd0c984a6963f82", "ja": "は？　な、なんですか、いきなり。\nうれしいですけど……でも違うんですってば～！", "zh": "什么？你、你怎么突然这么说？\n在下是很开心……但你误会了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c2c275bbe22b831f980f6b68e9106741842e37b623e65501e43a4ce471b3b190", "ja": "いや、違わないよ。ライオンの凛々しさは、\n真にはもう、いらないと思うんだ。", "zh": "不，我没有误会。\n我认为真已经不需要像狮子那样威风凛凛了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "f5caf0d1e77ddca2f869c52bcc09acdd053e858c935c69572fc445d16049994a", "ja": "えっ。でも、ボク……。", "zh": "咦？可是，在下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2004_p", "source_sha256": "a01bb9d6aba27b76bca026ec433ff73e116420336136857561cb1a7311eac147", "ja": "ファンの期待に応えるため、本物になりたい。\nそう願う今の真は、俺の目には……。", "zh": "为了不辜负粉丝期待，而想成为正牌的存在。\n追求如此境界的真，在我的眼里看来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2005_p", "source_sha256": "e1ef7131d36189f47dcd813b709420df500d781e10c7c180f71a0672307e505d", "ja": "本当に凛々しい魂をもった、\n本物のアイドルに見えるよ。", "zh": "灵魂已经充满凛然气势，\n是正牌的偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2006_006mak", "source_sha256": "4e8f75cadba43dcdcfdf6508ae536fe04d88329382373eb96827329b5c4281ba", "ja": "本物の、アイドル……。", "zh": "正牌的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2007_p", "source_sha256": "eec4f1749bd8473df4632a45af0f420eef67a6890361f0ba3fd8f0a7f9849b28", "ja": "もう本物なんだから、別の物にならなくていい。\nそう思わないか？", "zh": "既然已经是正牌，就没必要再变成其他存在。\n你不这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2008_006mak", "source_sha256": "09e1b12f86559894fecb3da5277f84ff786288f6f9c5d3c1547672eb74f893d8", "ja": "ボクが……本物の、アイドル……。\nそ、そんなの、十年早いですよ～。へへっ！", "zh": "在下是……正牌的偶像……\n在、在下还早得很啦～嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2009_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb876e7f8c06f5ecbf5da0417cfad7d447a930b424f9c5098ec2fb05791568bf", "ja": "でも……、ありがとうございます。\nそういってもらえて、なんだかスッキリしました。", "zh": "不过……谢谢你。\n听到你这么说，在下就释怀了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2010_006mak", "source_sha256": "c692f0f172ee52822dbcefa6d0e456c70c4caa7babd8342c5aa1ecf9c5eb0e90", "ja": "ボクが本物になるために、向き合うべきなのは……\nきっとあの子達じゃなくて、ファンのみんな、ですね！", "zh": "为了成为正牌，在下应该放在心上的……\n一定不是之前的小白狮，而是粉丝们，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2011_006mak", "source_sha256": "45c4e77f178d9a359ae1bcdb39ce17027968b530c0c8c5c0fdc5bb1baaebd365", "ja": "よ～し、今度の公演で、\nみんなをガツンとメロメロにしちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "好～下次的公演，\n在下要用力抓住大家的心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0084_2012_p", "source_sha256": "0cc61426165f8ce939c1b00e7cdd35bf791d7f5d9d70389b200b44134505ca22", "ja": "（迷っていても、目標を見つければまっしぐら。\n……そんなしなやかさも、ライオン似なのかもな！）", "zh": "（就算迷失方向，但只要找到目标就会勇往直前。\n……如此柔软的身段，或许跟狮子很相像呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
